Reliefs sought 1. To declare G.O.Ms.No.306 dated 14.09.2007 as illegal;
2. To set aside the order of the Tribunal dated 20.08.2015 passed in O.A.No.3806/2008 and order dated 09.11.2015 passed in R.A.No.2522/2015;
3.To consider the case of the petitioner for promotion to the post of Food Inspector (non- gazetted), as well as Food Safety Officer, on par with his juniors, by reviewing all the promotions made after G.O.Ms.No.306.
1.

To declare the proceedings dated 01.04.2015 of the Commissioner of Health and Family Welfare as illegal;
2. To declare the proceedings dated 7.04.2015 of the Assistant Food Controller as illegal;
G.Sreeramulu, S/O. Veerabasavaiah, ... vs 1.State Of A.P. Represented By Tis ... on 28 April, 2017 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/36590225/
